Rev0853 GCC 14.2 Debug all-target build evidence

The cloudtainer command window interrupted phase 1 after 61/141 actions. Ninja
reported no compiler or linker failure. The exact same build directory and
unchanged source were immediately resumed; phase 2 completed the remaining
80/80 actions successfully. A subsequent quiescence pass relinked ten targets,
and the final dependency-closure invocation reported `ninja: no work to do.`

